sh. Apply, IMMEDIATELY read_mixer_track again — second\n  ▎ calibration data point. Ctrl+R, report.\n  ▎ 7. Idempotency. Re-call apply_sidechain with same source/target. Confirm\n  ▎ send_already_existed: true.\n  ▎ 8. Revert step 6. Confirm decisions.json flips that record to outcome:\n  ▎ "reverted".\n  ▎ 9. Summary. Two calibration tables (gentle + squash, requested-vs-actual per ▎ param), predicted-vs-actual deltas across all four destructive steps,\n  ▎ anything weird you noticed.'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'text': "I'll work through this methodically, one step at a time. Let me start with the orientation.", 'type': 'text'}, {'id': 'toolu_0123ZfPbSGeeQwGp35sz1gTX', 'caller': {'type': 'direct'}, 'input': {}, 'name': 'get_workspace_status', 'type': 'tool_use'}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_0123ZfPbSGeeQwGp35sz1gTX', 'content': '{"project_name": "projectMind", "root": "C:\\\\Users\\\\Chapo\\\\StudioMind\\\\projects\\\\projectmind", "fl_project_path": null, "stems_dir": "C:\\\\Users\\\\Chapo\\\\StudioMind\\\\projects\\\\projectmind\\\\stems", "masters_dir": "C:\\\\Users\\\\Chapo\\\\StudioMind\\\\projects\\\\projectmind\\\\masters", "references_dir": "C:\\\\Users\\\\Chapo\\\\StudioMind\\\\projects\\\\projectmind\\\\references", "drops_dir": "C:\\\\Users\\\\Chapo\\\\StudioMind\\\\projects\\\\projectmind\\\\drops", "stems": [], "masters": [], "references": [], "drops": []}'}]}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': [{'text': 'Workspace is clean — no prior renders, no references. Now let me read the three tracks. Starting with the kick:', 'type': 'text'}, {'id': 'toolu_01AFG62orihtBXgosbCnfvAe', 'caller': {'type': 'direct'}, 'input': {}, 'name': 'read_project_state', 'type': 'tool_use'}]}, {'role': 'user', 'content': [{'type': 'tool_result', 'tool_use_id': 'toolu_01AFG62orihtBXgosbCnfvAe', 'content': '{"bpm": 140.0, "ppq": 96, "playing": 0, "recording": 0, "loop_mode": 1, "changed": 2, "channels": [{"index": 0, "nam